WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.900
Your job just changed.

00:00:02.200 --> 00:00:04.000
Everyone ships with AI now.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:05.400
[Typing] make me a landing page

00:00:06.700 --> 00:00:09.700
And it all looks the same.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Art direction? Handled.

00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:14.000
Orvio. Studio-grade themes
your AI can build from.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:16.400
[Typing] Build an agent landing page
with Sparvek

00:00:17.800 --> 00:00:20.000
Follow the work all the way through.
In a breeze.

00:00:20.200 --> 00:00:22.000
Odile, sales intake. Reads every
inbound first. Will not guess a budget.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Bastien, scheduling. Holds the slot,
checks it twice, then asks before booking.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:26.000
Wren, CRM upkeep. Keeps every record
current and says exactly what changed.

00:00:26.500 --> 00:00:28.000
They look strange. They work exactly.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:33.000
Eleven pages. Full source.
Yours to ship.

00:00:33.300 --> 00:00:35.000
Your turn. Get Sparvek.

00:00:35.200 --> 00:00:42.000
[Score swells]

00:00:42.500 --> 00:00:46.000
Orvio. Studio-grade design.
For your next project.
